      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Haiku is a new open-source operating system that specifically targets personal computing. Inspired by the BeOS, Haiku is fast, simple to use, easy to learn and yet very powerful.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
